@startuml
title HomeFinder 5.5D — Three-House Presentation and Physical Travel Contract

actor User
rectangle "Application Authority" as APP {
  rectangle "Logical presentation destination" as LP
  rectangle "Auth / Roles / Business Rules" as SEC
  rectangle "HTML / CSS / JS / Animation / Responsive" as UI
}
rectangle "Canonical HomeFinder.sh3d" as SH3D {
  rectangle "Authored rooms / objects" as GEO
  rectangle "Authored doors / openings" as DOOR
  rectangle "Authored cameras" as CAM
  rectangle "Validated physical routes" as ROUTE
}

rectangle "House 1\nPublic / Hero\nindex.html + legal/footer" as H1
rectangle "House 2\nBroker + Operations" as H2
rectangle "House 3\nSeekers + Owners" as H3

User --> APP
LP --> UI
APP --> LP
APP --> SEC
UI --> SH3D : request logical destination
SH3D --> CAM : resolve physical camera
SH3D --> ROUTE : resolve validated path
ROUTE --> DOOR : execute door sequence
ROUTE --> GEO : traverse geometry

H1 -[hidden]right- H2
H2 -[hidden]right- H3

note right of ROUTE
No teleportation.
No wall penetration.
No invented routes.
Exit → door animation → traverse →
house threshold → destination hero settle.
Travel duration comes only from
authored/validated spatial route data.
end note
@enduml
